Hi Nadia,

We have hit a problem in the Kite 3.0 beta. Users who have more than one role=
 (for example planner and approver) cannot sign in through single sign-on: af=
ter the SAML redirect they get "role mapping failed". Users with a single rol=
e sign in fine.

This affects 14 of our 60 users, including all of our planners, so for now th=
ey are using passwords, which our IT team does not want long term.

Otherwise the feedback is good: the new dashboard and the saved views are a b=
ig step up and our planners are already using them daily.

Happy to jump on a call or share logs.

Regards,
Kwame Mensah
Operations Director, Holloway Logistics Ltd

